OL,4,BThe sandpaper plot - who was there,    
OL,5,Bwho said what?                         
OL,6,GThe sandpaper scandal, one of the      
OL,7,Gbiggest controversies in the history   
OL,8,Gof Test cricket, continues to engulf   
OL,9,GAustralian sport.                      
OL,11,FFresh evidence from Cameron Bancroft - 
OL,12,Fthe culprit of the ball-tampering in   
OL,13,FSouth Africa in 2018 - has heaped      
OL,14,Fpressure on Australia captain Pat      
OL,15,FCummins, former coach Darren Lehmann   
OL,16,Fand Cricket Australia.                 
